    "Records battus, chronos et alerte de vitesse annoncés dans votre casque (intercom Bluetooth) ou par le haut-parleur. La musique baisse pendant l'annonce." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Records, times and speed alerts are announced in your helmet (Bluetooth intercom) or through the speaker. Music is lowered during announcements."
          }
        },
